    "description": "This blueprint will create a UCS service profile either from an existing UCS service profile template or without using any template. In order to use the blueprint the following prerequisites must be met. <br><br>\r\n\r\nThe ucsmsdk and ucscsdk python libraries need to be installed manually on the CloudBolt appliance using pip. (i.e pip install ucsmsdk && pip install ucscsdk)<br><br>\r\n\r\nIn CloudBolt, in Admin \u2192 Connection Info, you need to create a Connection Info called \u201cCisco UCS\u201d which contains IP address, username, and password to Cisco UCS.",
